" style=\"display: flex !important; justify-content: space-between !important;\"><div class=\"ve-italic\" style=\"font-style: italic !important;\">Scroll, Rare</div></div></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-py-0\" style=\"padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; position: relative;\"><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5px; height: 100%; cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; z-index: 5;\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-pb-2\" style=\"padding-top: 1px; padding-right: 4px; padding-left: 4px; padding-bottom: 0.5rem !important; position: relative;\"><div class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--2\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 5px;\">Using an Action to read the scroll creates a 5-foot Emanation originating from you. For 5 minutes, Fiends can't enter or affect anything in the area. However, if you move in such a way that an Fiend would be inside the area, the effect ends.</p><p>As an Action, a creature within 5 feet of the Emanation can attempt to overcome it, which forces the creature to make a DC <span class=\"ve-rd__dc\">15</span> Charisma saving throw. On a successful save, the creature ceases to be affected by the Emanation.</p></div><span class=\"col-resize-handle\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; right: 0px; width: 5